title = "Maintenance: Flood Report"
type = 0
text = "TUNNEL E FLOODED AGAIN.\nThe pumps only run with main power ON.\nDrain procedure: open the 4 pump valves to the pattern on the chart.\nThe chart got moved into CELL 7 when they turned it into a store room. Nobody wants to go in there now."
